OL,3,ASix killed in Krakow 'far-right'
OL,4,Ashooting, as three more bodies found in
OL,5,Aattacker's home
OL,6,
OL,7,FA gunman believed to have been inspired
OL,8,Fby far-right ideology has killed six
OL,9,Fpeople and injured more than a dozen in
OL,10,Fan attack in the busy centre of
OL,11,FPoland's second largest city.
OL,13,FPolice said the attacker drove onto
OL,14,FMain Market Square in Krakow on
OL,15,FSaturday and began randomly firing at
OL,16,Fpeople.
OL,18,FThe attacker, who was equipped with
OL,19,Fmilitary-style weapons and attire, was
OL,20,Fshot and subdued by police, one of whom
OL,21,Fwas critically injured in the process.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
